                        "entry_id": "27224674-2c67-3c07-a870-dfde74a586cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A country and island of Oceania, in the Pacific Ocean. Official name: Republic of Nauru."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
